hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1180","'Abdullah ibn Busr reported that the Prophet"
"1181","Qayla related"
"1182","Dhayyal ibn Hanzala said"
"1183","Abu Ruzayq related that he saw 'Ali ibn 'Abdullah ibn 'Abbas sitting\ncross-legged with one foot crossed over the other"
"1184","'Imran ibn Muslim said"
"1185","Salim ibn Jabir al-Hujaymi said"
"1186","It is related that Abu Hurayra said"
"1187","Anas ibn Malik related that the Prophet"
"1188","'Abdullah ibn Zayd ibn 'Asim al-Mazini said"
"1189","Al-Miswar said"
"1190","Ibn Tikhfa al-Ghifari reported that his father told him that he\nhad been one of the People of the Bench. He told him"
"1191","Abu Umama reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1192","Ibn 'Umar said"
"1193","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1194","Abu Umama said"
"1195","'Ali reported that the Prophet"
"1196","'Ali ibn 'Umara said"
"1197","Zuhayr reported that one of the Companions of the Prophet"
"1198","Abu Musa al-Ash'ari related that the Prophet"
"1199","When Ibn 'Umar left his house"
"1200","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1201","When it became clear to us that we should go to the Prophet"
"1202","Abu Hurayra said"
"1203","'O Allah"
